@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>AgriStream uses account details and role assignments to control access to farm monitoring information. Farmers can view their own farms, agronomists can view assigned farms, and administrators can access the system's farm records.</p>
<p>Monitoring records may include sensor readings, drone image metadata, alerts and recommendations. Passwords are stored as hashes. Contact your system administrator with questions about access or your account.</p>
<p>The deployment operator must provide its contact details, retention periods and applicable privacy terms before collecting production data.</p>
